  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Canopy - Taskforce on Nature-related Financial Disclosures (TNFD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The mission of the Taskforce on Nature-related Financial Disclosures (TNFD) is to develop and deliver a risk management and disclosure framework for organisations to report and act on evolving nature-related risks, with the ultimate aim of supporting a shift in global financial flows away from nature-negative outcomes and toward nature-positive outcomes. Global Canopy will contribute to TNFD both with staff and subgrant.</narrative>
  </description>
